{"id":"vod_md_6250","vodId":"6250","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"妄想学生会","name_cn":"妄想学生会","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231024-1/41056a6adcfe4cc7974904cd2124dd30.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为樱才学院的私立高中。原身为女子学校的樱才学院，迫于男女比例的社会压力，将作为综合学校向社会开放。今年，学校迎来了首批男性学员入学，虽然28:524的男女比例使新入校的男生们感到分外紧张，但作为一所综合性学校，樱才高中崭新的未来开始了。作为二十八分之一，津 田隆利（浅沼晋太郎 配音）以其各方面看来都无比普通的成绩获取了入学资格。在校园中，隆利结识了学生会会长天草筱（日笠阳子 配音），从而开始了自己的学生会生涯。书记七条天空（佐藤聪美 配音）、会计萩村铃（矢作纱友里 配音）、顾问横岛鸣子（小林优 配音）等女性陆续出现在了隆利的身边，而这些外表可爱美艳的女孩们，却都拥有着无论如何都不能用正常来概括的性格，这究竟是怎么回事？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-24 08:12:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/q5SrvecG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/YqooGOTB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/KR0NsIYK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/4JRfRBQT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/E9jtj3ls/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/yXNQfyEI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/tGaOVbKd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/UTIyyRNf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/i3zLoNHw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/dAYFDu54/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/1CcLRP2S/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/jFVdWYPi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231023/8YPnEya4/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:14.145Z"}